        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: امکان",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "امکان — imkān — \"a possibility; a chance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اگر بادل ہیں تو بارش کا امکان ہے۔ agar bādal haiṅ to bārish kā imkān hai. If there are clouds, there is a chance of rain."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "امکان (imkān) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic imkān, \"possibility\", of the same family as ممکن, \"possible\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
